00:42:52.450 --> 00:43:11.860
Samuel Smith: And we just define a particular convention for ACDCs that provide those wrappers, which includes a field that is… that holds the digest of the external data, and the convention for that, so that everybody knows that, oh, this is data that can't be certified.

380
00:43:12.120 --> 00:43:19.439
Samuel Smith: But it… but it's got this ACDC wrapper. Maybe there's a better wrapper, but I… but right now, I… I think ACDCs are sufficient.

